 "contents": "2-seat front cab hub: hub extrusion + loft nose, tiled floor (15 mm), white chamfered panel liner (20 mm, 8 mm seams) and panelled end walls, roof LED inlays, 2 orange side-wall seam stripes, 2 driving seats (mq01 command seats with hand controllers) on graphite rails, low driving dashboard (top below the windscreen sill) with glare pad and the mq03 three-screen console sunk into a dashboard bay, side EVA hatch (white coaming, rubber seal, door trim with handle / valve, hinge fairings), 2 rear-wall suitports (coaming, seal, inner hatch, handrails, control screen), ECLSS overhead cabinet above the hatch, stowage rack, 8 windows (6-pane wrap-around windscreen + 2 side) with black bezels + shades, extinguisher, first aid, hatch handrail",
 "notes": [
  "windscreen v2 (CD re-export 02:31, commit 2325749): 6-pane wrap-around windscreen (2 centre 0.58 x 0.78 + 2 outer 0.22 x 0.46 panes on the nose front face, 2 quarter panes 0.62 x 0.46 on the nose side facets); pockets / bezels / shades from the rebuilt iva window list; the 40 mm inner_centre flag is gone (iva now measured on the IML)",
  "dashboard v3: top lowered to 45 mm below the windscreen sill (clear of the tight windscreen bezels) (iva windscreen.sill_clear_cad_z 1.275 -> Godot y 0.055); the mq03 console moved from the nose end wall (it overlapped the new glazing) into a bay sunk into the dashboard, screens tilted to the driving eyes, top edge 20 mm below the sill",
  "windscreen bezels: 6 panes get tight 20 mm bezels (depth capped 45 mm into the liner), each clipped out of the neighbouring pane apertures and bezels so the corner mullions do not clash, reveals opened along the sight lines from both driving eye points (node_camera_1 / 2)",
  "suitports: 2 exterior suitport_rings / hatches on the rear wall (Godot x +-0.62, y 0.03) are not in the iva file -> interior coaming / seal / inner hatch added (flag)",
  "rack_1 (life support) stood in front of side EVA hatch 1 -> built as a compact overhead ECLSS cabinet above the hatch coaming (flag)",
  "windscreen vision (iva, from node_camera_1/2): down 20.0 deg / up 14.5 deg; fpv_windscreen render = driver view out through the windscreen"
 ],
